  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The current script in SDK 3.10.4 ( `com.vrchat.base\\Editor\\VRCSDK\\PerceptualPostProcessor.cs` ) has issues where it is not respecting the settings defined in the texture importer, resulting in broken mip-maps for textures which invert, configure, or otherwise modify the texture channels. This is because the script uses raw bytes / raw texture data pre-swizzling / modification.\n\nI have implemented the bug fix myself, and you can use my code or base your solution off of it if you like.",
